  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "藝術概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO THE FINE ARTS",
    "describe_ch": "針對八大藝術涉及範疇進行介紹與討論，使學子能進一步了解藝術的奧秘，提高藝術的修養、藝術創造力和藝術鑑賞能力，從而更加自覺地實現審美教育，成為全面和諧發展的一代新人。",
    "describe_eh": "Through the introduction and discussion on the eight art fields, students will understand the mystique of art, elevate their artistic cultivation, creativity, and appreciative abilities. Aesthetic education can be realized more self-consciously and the students' abilities can be developed more diversely.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
